  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support through United Nations Oficce for Project Services for United Nationas Assistance Mission for Iraq under Syria-Iraq 2019-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of this project is to enhance the credibility and transparency of Iraq&#x2019;s electoral process in full accordance with relevant national legal and policy frameworks. To help increase confidence in the electoral processes, and in response to Security Council Resolution 2576 (2021), UNAMI will further step up its electoral assistance and support by deploying an additional 130 UN experts with as broad a geographic coverage as possible, to - inter alia - monitor relevant developments on election day.</narrative>
  </description>
