   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 Strengthened, robust and visible UN team, with additional staff, in advance of Iraq&#x2019;s forthcoming election, is mobilized to monitor Iraq&#x2019;s election day</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="272115" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1. # international and international personnel (disaggregated by gender) mobilized in advance of Iraq&#x2019;s forthcoming election;

